---
/*
 * splash-animation-test.astro
 *
 * Sandbox surface for evaluating splash hero animations.
 *
 * Live preview: 5 map-based hero iterations from Claude Design (A-E),
 * each stacked vertically in the full splash hero shell so we can see
 * what each would look like in context.
 *
 * The actual scene components live in public/_design/ as JSX files
 * loaded at runtime via Babel-standalone — keeps the production bundle
 * unaffected. Adjacent files: Maps.html (side-by-side artboard view),
 * Splash.html (original 8-scene tweaks-panel variant), scenes-map.jsx.
 *
 * noindex,nofollow so this never enters search results.
 */
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-CA">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Splash Animation Test — Sibley Creek (sandbox)</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <style>
    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .launcher {
      position: fixed; top: 12px; right: 12px; z-index: 9999;
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      padding: 10px 14px; font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; font-weight: 700;
      display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center;
    }
    .launcher a { color: #0a0a0a; text-decoration: none; padding: 4px 0; }
    .launcher a:hover { color: #D7263D; }
    .launcher .sep { color: #a8a8a8; user-select: none; }
    iframe.preview {
      display: block; width: 100%; border: 0;
      /* 5 hero previews stacked; each is roughly viewport-height. */
      min-height: 100vh; height: 540vh;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="launcher" aria-label="Sandbox launcher">
    <span>SANDBOX</span>
    <span class="sep">|</span>
    <a href="/_design/SplashMaps.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">5 Map Heroes →</a>
    <span class="sep">|</span>
    <a href="/_design/Maps.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Side-by-side</a>
    <span class="sep">|</span>
    <a href="/_design/Splash.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Original (8 scenes)</a>
  </div>

  <iframe
    class="preview"
    src="/_design/SplashMaps.html"
    title="Splash hero — 5 map animation iterations"
    loading="eager"
  ></iframe>
</body>
</html>
